          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "How good of you to drop by. I have some wonderful news! According to my notes, you are due for a new spell. Congratulations!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Dalia_Falmea.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/DaliaFalmea_ZFA_07.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38208,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You'll need to do a bit of research, however. You're also due for a bit of a vacation, so... well, two birds, one stone!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Dalia_Falmea.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/DaliaFalmea_ZFA_08.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38208,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The spell you will learn is the Rain of Fire, pulling molten fire from the earth into a flaming display of destruction!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Dalia_Falmea.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/DaliaFalmea_ZFA_09.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38208,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "First, though, a fire safety lesson! And no one knows the dangers of volcanoes more than the esteemed Tupa Taua of Celestia!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Dalia_Falmea.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/DaliaFalmea_ZFA_10.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38208,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You should go at once to speak with Tupa Taua, the counselor to the Water Moles in Celestia's Floating Land. Get to it!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Dalia_Falmea.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/DaliaFalmea_ZFA_11.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38208,
